.Dd November 16, 2026
.Dt SU 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm su
.Nd substitute user identity
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl
.Op Fl c Ar command
.Op Ar user
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
looks up
.Ar user
in the account database, verifies the target password with the
.Xr raven-auth 3
SHA-512-crypt verifier, and starts the account shell with
.Ev HOME ,
.Ev SHELL ,
.Ev USER ,
.Ev LOGNAME
and
.Ev PATH
set.
The
.Fl
form starts a login-style session and sets
.Ev PWD
to the home directory.
The
.Fl c
option runs one command through the shell.
.Pp
The 0.2.0 command implements the root-to-root path.
Switching to a non-root account needs the
setuid binary and the kernel credential operation from U3; this release reports that gap
instead of pretending the switch succeeded.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width /etc/passwd -compact
.It Pa /etc/passwd
account records
.It Pa /etc/shadow
password records
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
A usage error exits with status 2.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr id 1 ,
.Xr passwd 1 ,
.Xr whoami 1
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD.
